      - "Kh\xF4ng sao \u0111\xE2u, Draff, \u0111\xE3 c\xF3 b\u1ECDn m\xECnh \u1EDF
        \u0111\xE2y r\u1ED3i"
      - "T\u1EEB gi\u1EDD b\u1ECDn m\xECnh s\u1EBD b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 c\u1EADu"
      - "B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 h\u1EA1 h\u1EBFt l\u0169 qu\xE1i v\u1EADt \u0111\xF3
        sao? B\u1EA1n, nh\u1EEFng h\u1EA1t d\u1EBB, \u1ED1ng c\xE2y n\xE0y..."
      - A!
      - "Sketon, m\xECnh c\xF3 \xFD n\xE0y!"
