  dialogueList:
    dialogues:
    - name: Krixim
      lines:
      - "Sketon, Nh\xECn k\xECa!"
      - "Nh\u1EEFng c\xE1i x\xE1c c\u1EE7a b\u1ECDn qu\xE1i v\u1EADt!"
      - "\u0110\xF3 l\xE0 b\u1ECDn qu\xE1i v\u1EADt do t\xEAn Th\u1EA7n Ch\u1EBFt
        g\u1EEDi \u0111\u1EBFn, b\u1ECDn ch\xFAng t\xE0n ph\xE1 khu r\u1EEBng."
      - ...
      - "M\xECnh nh\u1EADn ra nh\u1EEFng qu\u1EA3 h\u1EA1t d\u1EBB n\xE0y!!!"
      - "\u0110\xF3 l\xE0 nh\u1EEFng h\u1EA1t m\xE0 Draff hay \u0103n."
      - "C\xF3 th\u1EC3 Draff \u0111\xE3 d\xF9ng nh\u1EEFng h\u1EA1t d\u1EBB n\xE0y
        \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1ECDi ch\u1EBFt l\u0169 qu\xE1i v\u1EADt"
      - "Kh\xE1 l\u1EAFm, Draff!!!"
      - "Ch\xFAng ta c\xF3 th\u1EC3 \u0111i theo nh\u1EEFng x\xE1c ch\u1EBFt n\xE0y
        \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA7n \u0111\u1EBFn ch\u1ED7 c\u1EE7a Draff"
      - "Sketon, ta ph\u1EA3i nhanh ch\xF3ng t\xECm ra Draff!"
      - "B\u1EA1n \u1EA5y \u0111ang c\u1EA7n ch\xFAng ta!"
