    - name: Krixim
      lines:
      - "A, Draff! T\xECm th\u1EA5y b\u1EA1n \u1EA5y r\u1ED3i!"
      - "\xD4i, Draff! Ch\xFA s\xF3c nh\u1ECF n\u1EA5p trong \u1ED1ng c\xE2y, kh\xF4ng
